    27	This script:
    28	  1. Reads dom_q_centered_energy for each spike at d=14, 18, 20.
    29	  2. For thresholds τ ∈ {0.01, 0.02, 0.05}, finds k_char(d, τ).
    30	  3. Computes spike block sum and frac = block / π(N) at each (d, τ).
